# Project Always Rules

## Never commit
- `.env` / `.env.local` — secrets
- `agent-context/` (gitignored)

## Branch naming
`feat/[ticket-id]` · `fix/[ticket-id]` · `chore/[description]`

## i18n
User-visible strings use i18next when the app has `src/i18n/`.

## Theme
Use CSS variables / `baseline.md`. No random hex in new UI.

## State
Zustand in `src/store/` when needed. API in `src/services/api/`.

## Routing
React Router — register pages in `App.tsx`.

## PR size
Prefer PRs under ~400 lines changed.
